{{PCExclusive}}
'''Honda Tadakatsu''' was an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was exclusive to the VIP [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] Gacha, only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]].

